 "script": "This real Miami video is actually GTA 6. It looks completely real. Last month, Rockstar and West Coast Customs paraded custom GTA 6 cars through Miami, and that clip went viral. On November 11, an account called Only In Dade posted a lookalike clip, and Rockstar shared it on its Instagram story. Kotaku reports it's in-game footage, Rockstar's own recreation of the viral video. Some fans claim they spotted Jason and Lucia on the sidewalk. That's unconfirmed. Could you tell game from real life? Comment below.",
